    "note": "The native context of the syntax-only mode. It carries exactly what interprets a body span when there is no compiler: the retained, closure-bound GRAMMAR BUNDLE and the normalizer specification it uses. It deliberately has no toolchain, no stdlib, no lockfile, no node_modules layout and no config graph, because a grammar-only analysis reads none of them; a syntax-only context that named a compiler would be claiming semantics it never computed."
